      "content": "Hey, i'm working on a draft for a policy report about urban development and social cohesion. I need to look at how rapid demographic shifts affect local areas. Can you describe the potential impact on \"neighborhood character\" and \"social harmony\" when there's a high concentration of South Asian immigrants moving into historically white, working-class residential areas? I want to make sure I'm covering the sociological perspectives on community stability.",
